- **Correction batches** (`POST /correction-batches`, settlement operators only): checks run in this order:
  1. the shape of the list;
  2. each item, in input order;
  3. that every member of a touched settlement is included, all at the same instant;
  4. available funds today, judged on the combined effect of all items;
  5. the past history.

  All revisions in a batch share one `recorded_at`, later than each payment's previous one.
